   "updated_at": "2021-02-26T14:36:44Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>This is still ON! <img alt=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\"/><br/>\nPlease, if you’d like to contribute to Comms working group and TEC in general, or you know someone who would be interested reply to this thread or reach out in the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/FStbpNTjMy\">Comms Discord channel</a>.</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>",
